Package: rtreinus
Title: Access Treinus Workout Data via Private API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Eduardo", "Leoni", 
           email = "e.leoni@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0955-5232"))
Description: Provides authenticated access to the Treinus webapp API 
    (https://webapp.treinus.com.br) for retrieving workout data, training plans,
    and performance metrics. Handles ASP.NET WebForms authentication and session
    management. Also provides a session-analysis pipeline for crew boats, which
    infers crew membership and seat order from GPS, flags badly measured
    heart-rate and cadence traces, and computes per-crew pace, blocks and
    stroke-rate metrics.
